// Down special, charging (ext1): a frame of charge each frame, 80 in all. Special shoots (30 = ext2); shield or jump keeps the charge
// for later and ends the move with no lag (so the shield, roll, air dodge or jump comes out at once); a full charge keeps itself.
// Being hit loses what was being charged (it is only kept by `store`).
var c;
var quick;
var aim;
c = min(c + 1, 80);
if special_tap {
    goto(30);
} else if shield || jump {
    store(c);
    end();
} else if c >= 80 {
    store(80);
    end();
}
